@baseUrl = http://localhost:5299
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@email = REPLACE_WITH_EMAIL
@password = REPLACE_WITH_PASSWORD

# Never commit real passwords or tokens to this file.
# See docs/BACKEND_GUIDE.md for Manager bootstrap and owner email verification.

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### OpenAPI (Development)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Current account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Enum names for frontend selects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metadata/enums
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Horses in current user's scope
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/horses?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Scoped report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports?groupBy=Week
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?unread=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
